  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e14-scene-13",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "第一顺位与护短  (First-Choice Casting and Standing By Her Boyfriend)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美",
    "agent": "经纪人"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At the merger banquet, the newly partnered talent agency reveals that Chun Yuqiao's top casting pick has been shelved and pushes a replacement star forward—until Xin Huimei steps in for her boyfriend. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "跟你们介绍一下，这是我们公司的一哥贾喆，打个招呼。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们经纪公司的一哥不是荣思纶吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "是这样，荣思纶跟老板有点小误会，被雪藏了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "在魅力远航的阵容安排上，我们的第一顺位是荣先生。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没想到现在是这个结果。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "那正好，第一顺位就让贾喆来吧，来敬淳于总一杯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不喝酒。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你怎么才来啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "介绍一下啊，这是我男朋友，淳于乔。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "淳于总胃不太好，我帮他喝一杯，我先去漱个口。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "跟你们介绍一下，这是我们公司的一哥贾喆，打个招呼。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me introduce our agency's leading man, Jia Zhe—come say hello.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你们经纪公司的一哥不是荣思纶吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Is your talent agency's leading star not Rong Silun?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "是这样，荣思纶跟老板有点小误会，被雪藏了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, Rong Silun had a minor misunderstanding with management and has been shelved.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "在魅力远航的阵容安排上，我们的第一顺位是荣先生。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In our casting lineup for Charming Voyage, Mr Rong Silun was our number-one pick.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "没想到现在是这个结果。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I did not expect things to turn out like this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "那正好，第一顺位就让贾喆来吧，来敬淳于总一杯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then that works out nicely—let Jia Zhe take the top spot and toast Mr Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "不喝酒。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I do not drink alcohol.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你怎么才来啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What took you so long to get here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "介绍一下啊，这是我男朋友，淳于乔。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Allow me to introduce my boyfriend, Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "淳于总胃不太好，我帮他喝一杯，我先去漱个口。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yuqiao has a delicate stomach, so I will take this toast for him—now excuse me while I rinse my mouth.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "跟你们介绍一下，这是我们公司的一哥贾喆，打个招呼。",
